    "limits": [
      "Petrification profiles use independently initialized defense sets/bypasses and explicit status documents; actor statuses mayretain a later-immune status,while rulequeries suppress it. No preset generation/source bootstrap acceptance",
      "Family profiles are explicit serialized status sets,not fromStatusEffect preset generation; source type never grants missing statuses. SimpleTraitField CI accepts strings without a fixed choices registry; literal membership does not resolve content",
      "Family mode matrices use frozen independent source/condition predicates and raw counts; not native output or module totals as expectations",
      "Nonpersisted map selection uses actual DataModel._initialize,MappingField/ObjectField initialization; field constructors and initialization-order/getDefiningClass helpers are declared restricted stubs,not complete model boot",
      "Movement inputs are initialized numeric intermediates with explicit ft/m,bonus and multiplier; source FormulaField/schema/Item/effect initialization remains separately qualified and no new expression evaluator is used",
      "Condition derived map writes precede initial guard evaluation; inactive final guard may leave map entries without effective status/reduction. Last active duplicate writes the map,not sum/max",
      "Controlled initialized model phase qualification,not module implementation,full DataModel/native runtime/operator acceptance",
      "Exact primitive Boolean/String/Number/Array/Set cleaning/initialization on copies; source definitions statically verified,not full DataModel validation/migration/source lifecycle",
      "Class/proficiency and ability score fixtures are independently initialized inputs; no class grant/content resolution",
      "Model base preparation hooks,Item/replacementData and callback constant guard are declared stubs; no arbitrary/dependent Filter qualification in this harness",
      "No custom AppliedRules/flags,travelpace,Item/clock/origin behavior; numeric constants only,unrelated attack/AC/savecover fields explicit",
      "CI add/remove executor is synthetic; native initial aggregation,suppression,normalization/query timing is observed,not full native field update or write acceptance",
